00:18:34.176 --> 00:18:37.060
So, the team here is actually
a mixture of Apoorva,

00:18:37.061 --> 00:18:40.585
who's here, one of the first
graduates, Apoorva, yes.

00:18:40.586 --> 00:18:43.370
She's another first graduate
