00:18:48.396 --> 00:18:49.640
There are lots of
students who are

00:18:49.641 --> 00:18:51.545
interested in this work as well.

00:18:51.546 --> 00:18:57.475
So, it started with this Project
Karya in 2017 August.

00:18:57.476 --> 00:19:00.315
Again, things are clipped
there at the end.

00:19:00.316 --> 00:19:03.050
We had, through this interaction,

00:19:03.051 --> 00:19:06.030
around 10 students who
typed 4,500 words.

00:19:06.031 --> 00:19:10.830
They generated work worth
36,000 rupees, which was good.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:16.220
We didn't want, one philosophy
we've tried to follow is,

00:19:16.221 --> 00:19:18.710
not do any interactions
within the projects.

00:19:18.711 --> 00:19:22.885
So, we try to keep the
interaction a live beyond career.

00:19:22.886 --> 00:19:25.090
We in fact built a tool,

00:19:25.091 --> 00:19:26.520
the team you see,

00:19:26.521 --> 00:19:27.980
there are the guys
who actually did

00:19:27.981 --> 00:19:29.810
the digital work whom
we had identified,

00:19:29.811 --> 00:19:32.360
and then we want them
to be laid down.

00:19:32.361 --> 00:19:33.790
So, we actually
developed the tool

00:19:33.791 --> 00:19:34.900
which will help them do

00:19:34.901 --> 00:19:37.750
interact to OCR because we
got several OCR assignments,

00:19:37.751 --> 00:19:39.670
where you have scanned documents,

00:19:39.671 --> 00:19:41.620
and you need to get them
into digital format.

00:19:41.621 --> 00:19:43.810
But obviously,
no automatic system

00:19:43.811 --> 00:19:44.960
is 100 percent perfect.

00:19:44.961 --> 00:19:47.535
How do you do OCR post editing?

00:19:47.536 --> 00:19:50.560
But what we realized is
there was absolutely

00:19:50.561 --> 00:19:53.770
no platform for
accumulating jobs,

00:19:53.771 --> 00:19:55.590
identifying the skill
levels of people,

00:19:55.591 --> 00:19:57.725
their interest levels,
their time availability.

00:19:57.726 --> 00:20:00.605
Doing this matching
was a major issue.

00:20:00.606 --> 00:20:03.570
That's when we went
to the second part.

00:20:03.571 --> 00:20:05.065
We said, "Well,
all that is fine."

00:20:05.066 --> 00:20:06.730
We still have the two, we're

00:20:06.731 --> 00:20:07.885
